{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e9f55a58521e1b299663009bfb4073d064d474bc7515cd21b05df1141cd618d1","ja":"面白いことねぇ……そういえば、世界的に有名な\n海外の歌手が、近くの楽屋にいるみたいよ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"eccfaee27942c91d2b018bedf36d8f3760fd8a285c234ae17a2f4e8eaea5931e","ja":"そうなんだ？　出演するのは知ってたから、\nちょっと気になってたんだけど。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3ce09ce32fcd019102e114270bb7869ddb99efcb800de72f28eaf21be525509c","ja":"でも、ここに来るまでに\nお見かけしませんでしたね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"66edac8c3ad2365852269e0465d0e72c1696bfd517ef553d86b88054cea8e485","ja":"んっふっふ～、ふたりとも気になるみたいだね～？\nんじゃあ、楽屋挨拶に行ってみる？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"1b3dccd0ca73c7c5c463b16df0a23b7e8383b09c186d85d1671d2794117756dd","ja":"いいの！？　海外の大物アーティストって、\n警備とかすごいって思ってたんだけど？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c6ee373bf2d9d90911c455b6f171f25773bb841513b46519947213dede3c98a4","ja":"アイドルはアピールしないとだよ！　兄ちゃんも\nよく顔はメイシンって言ってるし、挨拶は大事っしょ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"180b82a59b610c6cbcc37c68d65e7c0919ed9800799600e486c4df423cfc4f5d","ja":"それを言うなら、迷信じゃなくって名刺でしょ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"1898355cf43eff08c1fb11298deefde17964bab1f43f32e465cee3262037c257","ja":"それに挨拶って、亜美が暇つぶししたいだけじゃない。\n出番まで大人しく待ってた方がいいと思うわよ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"a1a863c21a6386b0e22d62ea166bd7684e0d9c5c0f906642ead020f02d32789a","ja":"でも出番まではまだまだ時間あるよね……。自分も\n待ちくたびれたし、その歌手に会ってみたいぞ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"738a1e3ed6617da4427481613edae0b3e637681580adf399e1af27c323d1bd95","ja":"さっすがひびきん！　さあ、いおりんはどうする？\nこのままだといおりんだけ、お留守番になっちゃうよ？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"f548103d7fe34fdd0674dbabb9a46366f51b53bbe413b4e4571ae2c37460db24","ja":"わ、私だけって……！？\n分かったわよ！　そんなに言うなら私も行くわ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
